OL,3,GNEWSAArrests made in island-wide drug
OL,4,Asearches
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn individual suspected of selling
OL,7,Fillegal substances to youngsters was
OL,8,Famong those who have been arrested
OL,9,Fduring targeted drugs raids.
OL,11,FGuernsey Police said it carried out
OL,12,Fwarrant searches across the island this
OL,13,Fweek in a bid to target suspected drug
OL,14,Fdealers.
OL,16,FSelling illegal substances to young
OL,17,Fpeople was "a serious aggravating
OL,18,Ffactor," the force said.
